TI  - 3D Reconstruction in Crime Scenes Investigation: Impacts, Benefits, and Limitations
T2  - Intelligent Systems and Applications (IntelliSys 2024), Lecture Notes in Networks and Systems, vol. 1065, pp. 46–64, Springer
